   "evidence": "Mathlib `norm_def`: `z.norm = z.re * z.re + b * z.re * z.im - a * z.im * z.im`; `trace_def`: `trace z = 2 * z.re + b * z.im` (Mathlib/Algebra/QuadraticAlgebra/Basic.lean:271,402). With a = -r\u00b2, b = 2r these give (x+ry)\u00b2 and 2x+2ry.",
